{
 "encounter_id": "00646",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "FAMILY_MEMBER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hello, doctor, sorry, I have forgotten what I was going to say. Lakshmi, what did we come about? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "The fever, Ramesh. The one from the rains. He's better, doctor, but he's still not himself."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Grand. I'm Dr Brennan, and I'll go slowly. You had a fever illness in the monsoon, is that right? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Three weeks ago. High fever for five days, terrible body pain, and a rash at the end. The hospital said dengue, or something like it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That sounds like a hard week. How are you now, Ramesh?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tired. I get so tired by the afternoon, I can't do what I used to. I just have to lie down."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "He's asleep by three every day. He was never like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever since it broke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever. No, that's gone."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. What tablets are you taking, let's go through them with Lakshmi's help."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Paracetamol, 650 mg, when needed. And, what's the other, for the sugar..."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Metformin, 500 mg twice a day. And the one for blood pressure, amlodipine, 5 mg once a day. You never remember that one."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "She's right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Are you allergic to anything, any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I had some rash from a sulfa tablet once. Years ago."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Noted. And what other conditions do you have?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Diabetes, for twelve years, and high blood pressure. Nothing else."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Who's at home with you?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My wife and the two boys. We all live together, in the old house."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Lovely. Let me get your numbers. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Of course. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 78, blood pressure 138 over 84, temperature 36.8, oxygen 98 percent, weight 71 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "He's lost weight. He was seventy-four. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "He's lost a few kilos, which fits with being ill for a week. Let me press your tummy, Ramesh. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's not sore. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Soft, and no tenderness, and I can't feel your liver edge.",
   "pause": 12.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that good? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's what I wanted to find. So, all in all, the tiredness fits with the recovery period after a viral illness like dengue, and I'd call it post-viral fatigue."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "How long will it last? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Often a few weeks, sometimes longer. It does pass, but it can't be rushed. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What can I do? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Short walks, regular meals, and rest when you need it, but not all afternoon, or the nights get worse."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "He drinks very little water. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please, Ramesh, drink more, especially in this heat. Aim for eight glasses."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will try. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in four weeks to see how you're getting on."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "We will come. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
